    "group": "Tectonic Fragdrill",
    "summary": "While the only units of yours in an enemy unit's **Engagement Range** are **FORTIFICATION** units:\n\n- that enemy unit can still be targeted by ranged attacks, but those attacks get -1 to Hit unless made with a Pistol\n- its models skip **Desperate Escape tests** when they Fall Back while **Battle-shocked**, unless they would cross enemy models in that move",
